/// # Safety
/// `ctx` is the live `EEMusicManager*`.
void ee_music_request_intensity(void *ctx, uint32_t intensity);

/// `DoPause`, `DoSetIntensity`, `DoStart`, `DoStop`, `NextSong`: 0..4.
